{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版清楚地建立了“相伴带来安慰—满足之后想让亲近延续—意识到对方心意未定—急切却无法落实”的因果链，也解释了舒适与阻力为何并存，但身体如何先于明确念头产生反应、试图恢复享受或继续推进为何反而无法解除牵挂，都只被概括为“有股力量拖住他”。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版既区分了安静余韵中的轻微不舍与后来短促的靠近冲动，也通过身体先于念头起动、无法确认对方心意、注意力反复卡住及越想确认越难推进的过程，解释了情绪转折和流动受阻的机制；其中防备松动和时间流逝等前提带有推断性，但没有把温柔余韵误写成主导焦虑或突然的悲剧。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙版保留了甲版关于亲近需求与不确定性冲突的核心因果关系，并进一步说明身体反应如何先于清晰念头、确认需求如何使注意力陷入循环并加重停滞，因此优势在于补足了具体机制而非单纯增加篇幅，尽管其部分前提仍比听感记录本身更具推断性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "06ce3c6b-c48f-4aad-bbd2-3d681b0442ce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134627748021Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:47:36.501885+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bd88761f10bf28c86a8375b5555a030bad6d3f4834d1e555d6cdb0aafe42e9cd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa